{{! Recursive deserializer-argument builder for a (possibly nested) container
    element type. Emits a model class constructor for a leaf model, an arrow
    cast for a leaf primitive or enum (a TS enum is structurally its string
    value, so a cast suffices), a `new Date(...)` arrow for a date/date-time
    leaf, or an arrow that re-enters deserializeArray / deserializeMap for each
    further container level — so the innermost leaves of a nested generic
    container (e.g. Array<Record<string, Foo>>) are decoded into typed values
    instead of left as raw objects. Enum and date leaves are routed BEFORE the
    model branch so they are not mistaken for model classes. }}
{{#isArray}}(x: unknown) => ObjectSerializer.deserializeArray(x, {{#items}}{{>deserialize_arg}}{{/items}}){{/isArray}}{{#isMap}}(x: unknown) => ObjectSerializer.deserializeMap(x, {{#items}}{{>deserialize_arg}}{{/items}}){{/isMap}}{{^isArray}}{{^isMap}}{{#isEnum}}(x: unknown) => x as {{{dataType}}}{{/isEnum}}{{#isEnumRef}}(x: unknown) => ObjectSerializer.deserializeEnum<{{{dataType}}}>(x, {{{dataType}}} as unknown as Record<string, unknown>){{/isEnumRef}}{{^isEnum}}{{^isEnumRef}}{{#isDateTime}}(x: unknown) => new Date(x as string){{/isDateTime}}{{#isDate}}(x: unknown) => new Date(x as string){{/isDate}}{{^isDateTime}}{{^isDate}}{{#isPrimitiveType}}(x: unknown) => x as {{{dataType}}}{{/isPrimitiveType}}{{^isPrimitiveType}}{{complexType}}{{/isPrimitiveType}}{{/isDate}}{{/isDateTime}}{{/isEnumRef}}{{/isEnum}}{{/isMap}}{{/isArray}}
